    "The stubs imitate SourceResponse (GET /api/v1/sources), BatchAccess (GET /api/v1/batches/accesses) and BatchView (POST /api/v1/batches). The offer on a file dropped in the chat is not played: only a desktop drop carries the path of a file, and the runner builds its files in the webview."
